codemap 8
path promote
kind flow
author ai
group cli
note The scaffolding command, and the reason building a flow is not tedious. promote turns a symbol's call tree into a path shaped like it: one step per symbol, each under the step it is called from, named after the root symbol. The result is a draft, not an answer: the agent then deletes the steps that do not belong to the workflow, re-parents anything the resolver placed wrong, and writes the notes. Running it again on the same path adds only the symbols the path does not already have, so a path can be deepened after a change.

